{"parse": {"title": "Noruto (Six Tails)", "pageid": 5375, "revid": 47315, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>If you were looking for a different Fox Ninja unit, see <a href=\"/wiki/Fox_Ninja_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Fox Ninja (disambiguation)\">Fox Ninja (disambiguation)</a></i>.\n</p>\n<center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face TEST\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #FFC71E; border-right: 4px solid #FFC71E; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #ffec90 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #f6d100, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Meta Unit</span><br />This unit is one of the most effective units in the game!</div>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p><b>Noruto (Six Tails)</b> is a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> unit. He can only be obtained by evolving <a href=\"/wiki/Fox_Ninja_(Sage)\" title=\"Fox Ninja (Sage)\">Fox Ninja (Sage)</a>\n</p><p><br />\nBefore evolving this unit, the unit must have 7500 Takedowns.\n<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stats_Overview\">Stats Overview</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Noruto (Six Tails)</h2>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden game-font-face advanced-tooltip\" style=\"position: relative; user-select: none;z-index: 5;color: #ffffff8f;font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"dottedText C(#3a3a3a)-Th-L\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -43px; right: 0; cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted;\">Why do I have different stats?</div><div class=\"tooltip-contents\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"game-tooltip&#95;&#95;container game-font-face\">Units in this game use a randomized system, where stats like damage are randomly rolled with about a 10% variance (like Dungeon Quest items). When you evolve a unit they also reroll their stats, but it will always be strictly better than the pre-evolved version.</div></div></div><div class=\"article-table mobileonly\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Frequently_Asked_Questions\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions\">Why do I have different stats?</a></i><br /></div><div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; z-index: 5;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; width: 124px; justify-content: flex-start; position: absolute; left: 234px; top: -48px; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;OFF mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%;\">\n<p>Buff\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;OFF\" style=\"display: none; transform: translate(0, -70px);\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;gap: 3px;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 10